 criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":235279,"global_rank":92161,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":15978},{"name":"jinyeom/Computational-Intelligence-Research","owner":"jinyeom","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyeom/Computational-Intelligence-Research","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Computational Intelligence Research","topics":[],"score":235271,"global_rank":92170,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":15979},{"name":"jayshah19949596/American-Sign-Language-Recognition","owner":"jayshah19949596","html_url":"https://github.com/jayshah19949596/American-Sign-Language-Recognition","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Developed a program that lets users search dictionaries of American Sign Language (ASL), to look up the meaning of unknown signs using Dynamic Time Warping with custom features.","topics":["american-sign-language","american-sign-language-recognition","computer-vision","dtw","dynamic-time-warping","python","sign-recognition"],"score":235268,"global_rank":92178,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":15980},{"name":"JeffreyCA/minimal-flask-app","owner":"JeffreyCA","html_url":"https://github.com/JeffreyCA/minimal-flask-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":235267,"global_rank":92180,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":15981},{"name":"JimmyALiu/GoogleColabConnect","owner":"JimmyALiu","html_url":"https://github.com/JimmyALiu/GoogleColabConnect","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Script to prevent Google Colab from disconnecting while training machine learning models","topics":[],"score":235267,"global_rank":92185,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"pyth